GPT-QModel LFM3-VL native Transformers bridge

No checkpoint modeling or processor Python is vendored here. The bridge selects
Transformers' Lfm3VlConfig, Lfm3VlForConditionalGeneration and Lfm3VlProcessor,
and its native Qwen2VLImageProcessor / Qwen3VLVideoProcessor media components.
Transformers is distributed under Apache-2.0; see its installed source notices.

The test metadata under tests/fixtures/ports/lfm3_vl (checkpoint_config.json,
checkpoint_processor_config.json) and the pinned tensor-inventory digest in the
LFM3-VL tests originate from LiquidAI/LFM3-VL-2B, revision
23387beda43c60310348e83e25f78f33c3140d3a. The accompanying LICENSE is the
upstream LFM Open License v1.0. Trained checkpoint tensors are not included.
